  "question_stem": "Two particles $P$ and $Q$, of masses $0.1$ kg and $0.3$ kg respectively, are at rest on a smooth horizontal plane. $P$ is projected directly towards $Q$ with speed $4u \\text{ m s}^{-1}$. At the same instant, $Q$ is projected directly towards $P$ with speed $u \\text{ m s}^{-1}$. After $P$ and $Q$ collide, $P$ moves with speed $2 \\text{ m s}^{-1}$ and $Q$ moves with speed $4 \\text{ m s}^{-1}$.",
